  "question": {
    "text": "A hollow sphere is rolling on a plane surface about its axis of symmetry. The ratio of rotational kinetic energy to its total kinetic energy is $\\frac{x}{5}$. The value of $x$ is _____ .",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & \\frac{\\frac{1}{2} \\mathrm{I} \\omega^2}{\\frac{1}{2} \\mathrm{I} \\omega^2+\\frac{1}{2} \\mathrm{mv}^2}=\\frac{\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\left(\\frac{2}{3} \\mathrm{mR}^2\\right) \\omega^2}{\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\left(\\frac{2}{3} \\mathrm{mR}^2\\right) \\omega^2+\\frac{1}{2} \\mathrm{~m}(\\mathrm{R} \\omega)^2} \\\\ & =\\frac{\\frac{2}{3}}{\\frac{2}{3}+1}=\\frac{2}{5} \\\\ & \\mathrm{x}=2\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
